WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:23.324
Nina watched the other second graders run outside.

2
00:00:23.325 --> 00:00:26.631
Their parents were picking them up.

3
00:00:26.632 --> 00:00:30.914
But Nina's mom worked late.

4
00:00:30.915 --> 00:00:35.022
So Nina was going to Kids Central.

5
00:00:35.023 --> 00:00:38.990
Nina walked into the gym.

6
00:00:38.991 --> 00:00:43.114
She wished she could go home and play in her backyard.

7
00:00:43.115 --> 00:00:50.486
A big banner over the windows read "After-School Fun & Games @ Kids Central!"

8
00:00:50.487 --> 00:00:53.565
Nina didn't see anyone she knew.

9
00:00:53.566 --> 00:00:57.646
She felt nervous.

10
00:00:57.647 --> 00:01:01.866
"Oh, there's my name."

11
00:01:01.867 --> 00:01:10.944
Nina spotted a name tag with her name on it and sat down.

12
00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:15.729
Izzie was excited to be at Kids Central.

13
00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.849
But her name tag was wrong.

14
00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:24.318
"Isabel?" Izzie read. "I'm Izzie, not Isabel!"

15
00:01:24.319 --> 00:01:27.603
Izzie looked at the boy next to her.

16
00:01:27.604 --> 00:01:32.413
"You must be Jason."

17
00:01:32.414 --> 00:01:37.411
"Welcome, everyone! Please find your seat," Miss Shelly called.

18
00:01:37.412 --> 00:01:40.580
Miss Shelly was the Kids Central teacher.

19
00:01:40.581 --> 00:01:43.791
Nina thought she had a nice smile.

20
00:01:43.792 --> 00:01:50.364
"Today we're going to decorate name tags," Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:50.365 --> 00:01:53.603
A tall boy sat down next to Nina.

22
00:01:53.604 --> 00:01:56.670
He didn't say hello.

23
00:01:56.671 --> 00:01:59.830
But his name tag said "BOBBY."

24
00:01:59.831 --> 00:02:03.893
"Look through the magazines on your table.

25
00:02:03.894 --> 00:02:09.174
Cut out pictures of things you like," Miss Shelly said.

26
00:02:09.175 --> 00:02:14.373
"For example, Nina, what do you like?" Miss Shelly asked.

27
00:02:14.374 --> 00:02:16.185
Nina smiled.

28
00:02:16.186 --> 00:02:23.519
"I like the color purple and I like my rain boots," she answered shyly.

29
00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:28.015
"Nice! Jason, what do you like?"

30
00:02:28.016 --> 00:02:32.521
Miss Shelly waited. "Jason?"

31
00:02:32.522 --> 00:02:35.154
Izzie poked Jason's arm.

32
00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:39.276
"He likes video games," she said.

33
00:02:39.277 --> 00:02:43.495
"Jason, we don't play video games at Kids Central.

34
00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:48.035
Please put that away." Miss Shelly sounded serious.

35
00:02:48.036 --> 00:02:52.891
"Besides video games, what do you like?"

36
00:02:52.892 --> 00:02:56.716
Jason looked up. "Cheeseburgers."

37
00:02:56.717 --> 00:03:02.680
"Great! Start cutting!" Miss Shelly pointed to the magazines.

38
00:03:02.681 --> 00:03:09.767
"Please pass me that magazine," Nina said.

39
00:03:09.768 --> 00:03:14.961
"Please pass me those scissors," Bobby said.

40
00:03:14.962 --> 00:03:18.074
Izzie waved her hand in the air.

41
00:03:18.075 --> 00:03:21.566
"Miss Shelly? I need a new name tag.

42
00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:24.640
Only my grandma calls me Isabel.

43
00:03:24.641 --> 00:03:27.806
Everyone calls me Izzie."

44
00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:31.972
"I'm sorry! You can make a new name tag."

45
00:03:31.973 --> 00:03:35.842
Miss Shelly handed her some stiff paper.

46
00:03:35.843 --> 00:03:42.705
"Punch two holes in the top." Izzie punched.

47
00:03:42.706 --> 00:03:49.893
"Then write your name in big, beautiful letters.

48
00:03:49.894 --> 00:03:53.408
Now take all the pictures you cut out.

49
00:03:53.409 --> 00:03:56.143
Glue them onto your name tag.

50
00:03:56.144 --> 00:04:08.635
You can glue them on the front, on the back, or on both sides!

51
00:04:08.636 --> 00:04:12.307
When you're done, choose a piece of yarn.

52
00:04:12.308 --> 00:04:16.635
Thread it through the holes on your tag.

53
00:04:16.636 --> 00:04:21.123
Ta-da! Your name tag becomes a necklace!"

54
00:04:21.124 --> 00:04:26.883
Miss Shelly tied her name tag around her neck.

55
00:04:26.884 --> 00:04:43.799
"You could also hang it on your bedroom doorknob."

56
00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:48.032
"Nina, your mom's here," Miss Shelly called.

57
00:04:48.033 --> 00:04:53.827
Nina looked surprised. "Is Kids Central over already?"

58
00:04:53.828 --> 00:04:58.081
"Yep. Time to go home, sweetie," her mom said.

59
00:04:58.082 --> 00:05:02.851
"Bye, Miss Shelly!" Nina ran to her mom.

60
00:05:02.852 --> 00:05:10.399
"Look what I made!"

61
00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:19.949
[caption_out@
